{"1":{"w":[{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"جَاءَ","d":"jāa","e":"comes"},{"c":"نَصْرُ","d":"naṣru","e":"(the) Help"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَالْفَتْحُ","d":"wal-fatḥu","e":"and the Victory"}],"a":{"g":"When the victory of Allah has come and the conquest,"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَرَأَيْتَ","d":"wara-ayta","e":"And you see"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"the people"},{"c":"يَدْخُلُونَ","d":"yadkhulūna","e":"entering"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"into"},{"c":"دِينِ","d":"dīni","e":"(the) religion"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"أَفْوَاجًا","d":"afwājan","e":"(in) multitudes"}],"a":{"g":"And you see the people entering into the religion of Allah in multitudes,"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَبِّحْ","d":"fasabbiḥ","e":"Then glorify"},{"c":"بِحَمْدِ","d":"biḥamdi","e":"(the) praises"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"وَاسْتَغْفِرْهُ","d":"wa-is'taghfir'hu","e":"and ask His forgiveness"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"تَوَّابًا","d":"tawwāban","e":"Oft-Returning"}],"a":{"g":"Then exalt [Him] with praise of your Lord and ask forgiveness of Him. Indeed, He is ever Accepting of repentance."}}}